{"2953940": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Ancient Wars: Sparta HD", "steam_appid": 2953940, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Ancient Wars: Sparta HD – Relive the Golden Age of Real-Time Strategy</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready to experience one of the most epic chapters in RTS history. <strong>Ancient Wars: Sparta HD</strong> is a fully remastered edition that brings the legendary battles of the ancient world to a whole new level. Lead the <strong>Spartans, Persians, and Egyptians</strong> through monumental wars that will decide the fate of civilization.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With <strong>enhanced HD graphics</strong> and refined gameplay, this remaster immerses you in tactical warfare where every decision can change history. <strong>Customize your armies, master advanced strategies, and unleash devastating abilities</strong> to crush your enemies.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🔥 <strong>Customize</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don’t inherit an army—<strong>forge your own.</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Design and equip your troops with unique weapons and armor.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Capture enemy weapons and vehicles to turn them into your advantage.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adapt your army in real time to counter enemy strategies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2953940/extras/633d791729d1cd73a9d3548162fe1f0a.poster.avif?t=1787332336\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2953940/extras/633d791729d1cd73a9d3548162fe1f0a.webm?t=1787332336\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >⚔️ <strong>Conquer</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It’s not just about winning… <strong>it’s about domination.</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scale walls, break gates, and overrun fortresses in monumental sieges.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rule the seas with realistic naval battles: ram, board, and destroy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unleash advanced physics: deadly traps, chariots charging, and buildings collapsing under your might.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2953940/extras/32909acedba30132b2c91e0e485cf2ed.poster.avif?t=1787332336\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2953940/extras/32909acedba30132b2c91e0e485cf2ed.webm?t=1787332336\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >👑 <strong>Dominate</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every faction, <strong>a unique way of war</strong>. Every campaign, <strong>a legend to relive</strong>.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Command asymmetric civilizations: Spartans, Persians, and Egyptians with unique tactics, units, and playstyles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relive three historic campaigns: Sparta under Leonidas, Persia under Xerxes, and Egypt in rebellion.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grow your heroes with an RPG-style leveling and skill system.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2953940/extras/25739d67cf2752003963de81dbe11554.poster.avif?t=1787332336\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2953940/extras/25739d67cf2752003963de81dbe11554.webm?t=1787332336\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🏹 <strong>Compete</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Do you have what it takes to be remembered as a true <strong>legend</strong>?</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter the <strong>Sparta League</strong> and face players from around the world.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge smarter and more adaptive AI than ever before.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Only the most skilled will rise to eternal glory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2953940/extras/63e805bf57d382b74b151de25f806703.poster.avif?t=1787332336\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2953940/extras/63e805bf57d382b74b151de25f806703.webm?t=1787332336\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🛠️ <strong>Create</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don’t just play history—<strong>write your own.</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Design epic scenarios and battles with a powerful map editor.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Publish and download mods on <strong>Steam Workshop</strong>: a community of strategists building unforgettable experiences.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expand your game beyond the original with limitless content.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2953940/extras/58acdc2be70db730848f6fa549532178.poster.avif?t=1787332336\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_i